 "text": "The key is that the draft tokens are already available as inputs. We place those tokens into a sequence and apply a causal attention mask. Each position can attend only to the prompt and the draft tokens before it. That means the model can calculate the next token predictions for all these positions in parallel, without leaking information from future positions. Now, compare the draft tokens with the target model's predictions.",
